    "Applications": "</div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">See also: <a href=\"/school1/ptable/element/H\" class=\"wiki-link\" title=\"Hydrogen (H)\">Hydrogen</a> economy</div>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/school1/ptable/theme-assets/default/images/inline/8ec4e40c0c5fbc3d420f21e29aa27771.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"261\" style=\"--mw-file-upright: 2\" class=\"mw-file-element mw-file-upright\"  data-file-width=\"936\" data-file-height=\"488\" /><figcaption><a href=\"/school1/ptable/element/H\" class=\"wiki-link\" title=\"Hydrogen (H)\">Hydrogen</a> Ladder: Ranking of <a href=\"/school1/ptable/element/H\" class=\"wiki-link\" title=\"Hydrogen (H)\">hydrogen</a> applications and uses in the medium term, but analysts disagree</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\">"
